{"68a946fc-7ff0-434e-a500-34b3207efd6f":{"id":"68a946fc-7ff0-434e-a500-34b3207efd6f","title":"Class no Bocchi Gyaru wo Omochikaeri Shite Seiso Kei Bijin ni Shiteyatta Hanashi","altTitle":"A Story of Taking Home a Lonely Gal from My Class and Turning Her into an Elegant Beauty","description":"On a rainy night, Akira Akamori, a high school student about to transfer to a new school, saw his blonde classmate, Aoi Soutome, standing in the park drenched from the rain.\n\"...I don't have a home anymore.\"\nThough Aoi was a complete stranger to him, Akira couldn't leave a girl alone, so he took her home.\n\"Thanks for the help.\"\n\"I-It's fine...\"\nWhen Akira heard about Aoi's complicated situation, he decided to help her and let her live with him until he transferred to a new school. While confused by their new cohabitation arrangement, the two slowly grew close to each other.\nIt is a love story of two people who repeatedly come together and drift apart, like a spinning record.","year":2022,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Drama","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/68a946fc-7ff0-434e-a500-34b3207efd6f/fd6271a1-0cf8-4f6f-9e90-aa5849c64678.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["es-la","en","tr","fr","my","pt-br","id","vi"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.47,"follows":38328,"listAt":"2026-10-29T05:55:12.074Z","chapters":[{"id":"62f97638-1a0a-4aae-8e9f-c50249574aef","number":"38","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2026-10-23T05:07:04+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"6f901b15-3809-4f5f-b938-4c68571c13ce","number":"37","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":33,"createdAt":"2026-10-16T08:57:02+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"d97c1875-4e7e-43b9-98e7-8e2c033814bc","number":"36","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":39,"createdAt":"2026-10-13T09:16:13+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"93522875-e788-4d29-bac7-185a397b4b44","number":"35","volume":null,"tit